(7669920, 1251646, 124815, '<td valign="top">Reversed perspective - so common for the architecture of our times. The colors follow the trend. There is a lot of sadness in this image that might not reflect the vista in real life. A good story though.</td>', 'Reversed perspective - so common for the architecture of our times. The colors follow the trend. There is a lot of sadness in this image that might not reflect the vista in real life. A good story though.', '2020-07-16 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669923, 1251602, 124815, '<td valign="top">Something odd is happening with this image - and not only with this one. Depending on the monitor I look, the sharpness is more pronounced and halos are very prominent. Seeing it on a phone will probably be at its best. <br/>In any case, the setting is charming, the old glory and Mediterranean climate, flora and colors are there. <br/>The mystery of the saturation, sharpness and halos remain</td>', 'Something odd is happening with this image - and not only with this one. Depending on the monitor I look, the sharpness is more pronounced and halos are very prominent. Seeing it on a phone will probably be at its best. In any case, the setting is charming, the old glory and Mediterranean climate, flora and colors are there. The mystery of the saturation, sharpness and halos remain', '2020-07-16 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
